{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112093015076-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112100533\"/><p>黃仁勳（左）和黃樂（右）有婚外情。</p><p>美國傳媒周四（12日）引述消息指，與英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳發展婚外情的黃樂，目前在安全官員知情下正居於北京，未知她前往北京的原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:23:55.398909+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T01:30:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:37:21.401081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:17:22.533351+00:00","content_hash":"832912cd747095020b104369a17a67643db66b48520a50af6376562a548bdfa7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}